## A 16-value Transform, a 16-value ConcatTransform and a Basis with an inline matrix on
## both sides, each followed by a Sphere so a mis-counted read desyncs the next parse.
## Not third-party.
Display "matrixlength_controls.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 16 16 1
PixelSamples 1 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" [45]
Clipping 0.5 50
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
Transform [ 0.125 0.25 0.375 0.5 0.625 0.75 0.875 1 1.125 1.25 1.375 1.5 1.625 1.75 1.875 2 ]
Sphere 1 -1 1 360
ConcatTransform [ 2.125 2.25 2.375 2.5 2.625 2.75 2.875 3 3.125 3.25 3.375 3.5 3.625 3.75 3.875 4 ]
Sphere 1 -1 1 360
Basis [ 4.125 4.25 4.375 4.5 4.625 4.75 4.875 5 5.125 5.25 5.375 5.5 5.625 5.75 5.875 6 ] 3 [ 6.125 6.25 6.375 6.5 6.625 6.75 6.875 7 7.125 7.25 7.375 7.5 7.625 7.75 7.875 8 ] 3
Sphere 1 -1 1 360
WorldEnd
